        <Description ?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQ8>
        Replace the current global/workspace exact-FQN overlay contract with an Effective-VFS-first behavior, freeze the authority topology, compatibility boundaries, receipts and failing product tests before implementation.
        </?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQ8>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion { checked = false } ?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQ9>
          Behavior deltas distinguish path replacement, no-opinion fallback, explicit delete, VFS mutation, XNL content mutation and final FQN validation.
          </?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQ9>
          <Criterion { checked = false } ?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQA>
