        <Description ?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQH>
        Turn physical home/workspace .eidolon inputs into ordered overlay intent, atomically materialize and validate one Effective VFS revision, preserve the previous admitted revision on failure and expose compatibility projections only as read views.
        </?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQH>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion { checked = false } ?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQJ>
          Replacement removal and explicit deletion have distinct tested semantics, while move/rename and XNL mutation preserve declared identities.
          </?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQJ>
          <Criterion { checked = false } ?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQK>
          Stale revision, expectedId, valueBefore, duplicate resource or invalid Halfcode candidate cannot publish partial state.
          </?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQK>
        ]>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #G4-T1 { name = "Materialize Eidolon overlays into one Effective VFS" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
