        <Description ?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQM>
        Make registry projection, source capture, freeze/recovery and autonomous Agent authoring consume and transition the Effective VFS authority, then remove physical layer/FQN overlay ownership and long-lived dual writes.
        </?01M1C311TG98N6XJEKMCAZSJQM>
        <Gate [
